{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792463371, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}, "idle_time_limit": 2, "title": "bg3:test"}
[0.041695, "o", "$ node --import tsx tools/src/bg3-test.ts --scenario crooked.dead-aim\r\n"]
[50.389348, "o", "PASS mods-loaded: Required BG3 mods are loaded in order\r\n"]
[119.632051, "o", "PASS dead-aim-range: Dead Aim is loaded with an 18 metre target radius (expected \"18\", actual \"18\")\r\n"]
[119.632193, "o", "PASS dead-aim-cost-definition: Dead Aim is loaded with a one bonus action cost (expected \"BonusActionPoint:1\", actual \"BonusActionPoint:1\")\r\n"]
[119.632225, "o", "PASS dead-aim-start-turn-tick: Dead Aim readiness is configured to tick at start of turn (expected \"StartTurn\", actual \"StartTurn\")\r\n"]
[119.63226, "o", "PASS fixture-gameplay-ready: The disposable save reached controllable gameplay before fixture setup (expected \"true\", actual \"true\")\r\nPASS fixture-feature-origin: Actor features were prepared for mechanics; this does not validate a background grant (expected \"runtime-preparation\", actual \"runtime-preparation\")\r\nPASS fixture-features-ready: The prepared actor has the required passives and spells (expected \"2 passives, 2 spells\", actual \"2 passives, 2 spells\")\r\n"]
[119.632282, "o", "PASS fixture-line-of-sight: The temporary target has line of sight to the prepared hunter (expected \"true\", actual \"true\")\r\nPASS fixture-within-range: The disposable target was placed within Dead Aim's 18 metre range (expected \"<=18\", actual \"3.0074293613434\")\r\nPASS force-turn-based-entered: The hunter entered Force Turn Based before fixture actions began (expected \"true\", actual \"true\")\r\n"]
[119.632343, "o", "PASS bonus-action-available: The fixture began with a usable bonus action (expected \">=1\", actual \"1.0\")\r\n"]
[119.63238, "o", "PASS baseline-resistance: The resistant target halved the unmarked 8 Fire attack (expected \"4\", actual \"4\")\r\n"]
[119.632408, "o", "PASS foreign-mark-prepared: The target is marked by another ready hunter while the attacking hunter is also ready (expected \"true\", actual \"true\")\r\nPASS foreign-mark-resistant: Another hunter's mark does not bypass resistance for the ready attacker (expected \"4\", actual \"4\")\r\nPASS foreign-mark-not-consumed: Foreign damage preserves both hunters' readiness and the owned mark (expected \"true\", actual \"true\")\r\nPASS bonus-action-cost: Casting Dead Aim spent exactly one bonus action (expected \"1\", actual \"1.0\")\r\nPASS mark-owner: The Dead Aim mark belongs to the hunter that cast it (expected \"913c24f9-2e56-5b49-f539-0f06c73bb546\", actual \"913c24f9-2e56-5b49-f539-0f06c73bb546\")\r\nPASS start-turn-expiry: An unused Dead Aim expired at the start of the hunter's next turn (expected \"ready=false, mark=false, tracking=false\", actual \"ready=false, mark=false, tracking=false\")\r\n"]
[119.632429, "o", "PASS expired-hit-resistant: The attack remained resisted after the unused mark expired (expected \"4\", actual \"4\")\r\nPASS second-mark-owner: The second Dead Aim mark retained the same hunter owner (expected \"913c24f9-2e56-5b49-f539-0f06c73bb546\", actual \"913c24f9-2e56-5b49-f539-0f06c73bb546\")\r\nPASS marked-hit-bypasses-resistance: The marked attack ignored the target's Fire resistance (expected \"8\", actual \"8\")\r\nPASS positive-damage-consumes: Positive marked damage consumed Dead Aim and removed its owned mark (expected \"ready=false, mark=false, tracking=false\", actual \"ready=false, mark=false, tracking=false\")\r\n"]
[119.632462, "o", "PASS post-consume-resistant: Resistance applied again after Dead Aim was consumed (expected \"4\", actual \"4\")\r\nTIME crooked.dead-aim: 26000 ms\r\nPASS crooked.dead-aim\r\n"]
